{"evt":"note_created","id":"note-mqfi331z1rl","workspace":"/Users/imyu/Desktop/zonoid","title":"FeatureBench onboard inject must pass workspace flag to avoid live graph pollution","summary":"When injecting a foreign repo's onboard KB via scripts/onboard-learn.js --inject --confirm, you MUST pass --workspace <repo abs path>. Without it, inject defaults to the daemon LIVE workspace (/Users/imyu/Desktop/zonoid) and pollutes the live Zonoid graph with [ingest] foreign-repo notes that have no delete API. The isolated workspace also matches what scripts/export-kb.js queries (it passes --repo as the /search workspace param), so omitting --workspace makes export find zero notes. Confirmed by reading onboard-learn.js inject() at the workspace param comment block.","created_by":"main","valid_from":"2026-06-15T17:42:00.503Z","vec":[-0.09288010001182556,-0.015075677074491978,-0.036565572023391724,0.060858625918626785,0.06732502579689026,-0.025020774453878403,0.049828190356492996,-0.019927896559238434,-0.0052229128777980804,0.012155566364526749,0.05123491957783699,-0.02270669676363468,0.016589699313044548,0.04494650661945343,-0.011601186357438564,0.061484191566705704,0.07071350514888763,-0.13348327577114105,0.027639564126729965,0.015834448859095573,0.00950233917683363,-0.010600946843624115,0.08033650368452072,0.00419439934194088,0.05788670852780342,-0.050439249724149704,-0.05464150384068489,0.034885432571172714,0.04538185894489288,0.04081672057509422,0.018571432679891586,0.10912685096263885,-0.02024158649146557,-0.04197349771857262,0.04839777201414108,0.12015219032764435,0.029255062341690063,-0.09141876548528671,-0.06953202188014984,0.0012016097316518426,0.06498954445123672,0.10048572719097137,0.0005082793650217354,0.010072913952171803,0.027822943404316902,-0.01485715713351965,-0.11034239083528519,-0.11012336611747742,-0.018884889781475067,0.03529604896903038,-0.0604218952357769,-0.05919694900512695,0.02557162567973137,0.001311926986090839,-0.01051576528698206,0.0707633569836616